    "sections": {
        "description": "Technology Software Firm Theme offers a modern layout structure focused on clear content presentation and responsive performance. The theme includes customizable homepage sections, service displays, portfolio areas, pricing tables, blog templates, and team member sections. Its responsive framework adjusts content automatically across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. The interface uses organized spacing, simple navigation patterns, and flexible typography controls to maintain readability throughout the website. The theme provides customization settings for colors, backgrounds, headers, footers, and widget placements without requiring code modifications. It supports image galleries, sliders, testimonial sections, and contact form integration for managing communication and visual content. The codebase is designed to remain lightweight and compatible with commonly used SEO, caching, and translation plugins. Additional features include social media integration, menu customization, and multiple layout options for arranging content efficiently. The overall structure focuses on usability, consistent design elements, and adaptable page management for technology-focused websites."
    },
